{"recons(rus_guard)" "The Recon Squad is an 6 man skill 3 squad, capable of low-risk combat and reconnaissance missions. The squad carries no more than three magazines of ammunition per member. It is useful for getting people on the ground quickly.. Primary Weapons:2x PPSh-41 SMg 3x PPS-43 SMg 1x Mosin Nagant 1891/30 Rifle. Throwables:6x F1 AP Grenade 3x Incendiary Mixture."}
{"sapper_squad(rus_guard)" "The Sapper Squad is an 8 man skill 5 squad, capable of general combat and construction missions. The squad is useful for entrenching fighting positions and denying enemy ground with obstructions or mines. Primary Weapons:5x Mosin Nagant 1891/30 Rifle 2x PPS-43 SMg 1x PPSh-41 SMG. Throwables:16x F1 AP Grenade 2x Smoke Grenade. Consumables:24x First Aid Kit. Deployables:42x AP Mine 16x AT Mine8x Satchel Charge8x Shovel/Bags4x Trench Shovel1x Hedgehog 1x Mine detector."}
{"specialinf_smg(rus_guard)" "The SMG Squad is an 10 man skill 5 squad, capable of close quarters combat missions. The squad is useful for engaging enemy targets at close range. Primary Weapons:6x PPSh-41 SMg 3x PPS-43 SMG. Throwables:20x F1 AP Grenade 11x Smoke Grenade 6x Incendiary Mixture 2x RPG-43 AT Grenade 2x RPG-40 AT Grenade. Consumables:45x First Aid kit."}
{"specialinf(rus_guard)" "The Rifle Assault Squad is a 11-man skill 5 squad, capable of medium and close range combat missions. The squad is useful for engaging targets at medium range, and assaulting with an SMG group. Primary Weapons:3x SVT-40 Rifle 3x Mosin Nagant 1891/30 Rifle 2x PPSh-41 SMg 2x PPS-43 SMg 1x DP-27 LMG. Throwables:20x F1 Ap Grenade 5x Smoke Grenade 3x RPG-40 AT Grenade 2x RPG-43 AT Grenade 2x Incendiary Mixture. Consumables:55x First Aid Kit. Deployables:1x Shovel/bags."}
{"specialinf_rifle(rus_guard)" "The Rifle Squad is a 11-man skill 5 squad, capable of medium-range combat missions. The squad is useful for engaging targets at medium range. Primary Weapons:6x Mosin Nagant 1891/30 Rifle 2x SVT-40 Rifle 1x PPS-43 SMg 1x PPSh-41 SMg 1x DP-27 LMG. Throwables:18x F1 AP Grenade 4x Incendiary Mixture 3x Smoke Grenade 1x RPG-43 AT Grenade. Consumables:50x First Aid Kit. Deployables:1x Shovel/bags."}
{"guards_shock_assault(rus_guard)" "The Shock SMG Squad is a 11-man skill 6 squad, capable of close range assault missions. The squad is useful for assaulting enemy positions at close range. Primary Weapons:4x PPSh-41 SMG6x PPS-43 SMg 1x M2 Flamethrower. Throwables:20x F1 AP Grenade 11x Smoke Grenade 9x RPG-40 AT Grenade 2x Incendiary Mixture. Consumables:30x First Aid kit."}
{"guards_shock(rus_guard)" "The Shock Rifle Squad is an 11-man skill 6 squad, capable of medium range assault missions. The squad is useful for assaulting enemy positions at medium range. Primary Weapons:4x Mosin Nagant 1891/30 Rifle 3x SVT-40 Rifle 2x PPS-43 SMg 2x DP-27 LMG. Throwables:22x F1 AP Grenade 8x Smoke Grenade. Consumables:33x First Aid kit."}
{"elite_guards_smg(rus_guard)" "The Elite Guards SMG Squad is a 10-man skill 6 squad, capable of close range combat missions. Primary Weapons:5x PPS-43 SMG5x PPSh-41 SMG. Throwables:20x F1 AP Grenade 11x Smoke Grenade 9x RPG-43 AT Grenade 3x Incendiary Mixture. Consumables:50x First Aid kit."}
{"elite_guards(rus_guard)" "The Elite Guards Rifle Squad is an 11-man skill 6 squad, capable of medium range combat missions. The squad is useful for engaging targets at medium range. Primary Weapons:4x Mosin Nagant 1891/30 Rifle 2x SVT-40 Rifle 3x PPS-43 SMg 1x PPSh-41 SMg 1x. Throwables:20x F1 AP Grenade 5x Smoke Grenade 5x RPG-43 AT Grenade 3x Incendiary Mixture. Consumables:55x First Aid Kit. Deployables:1x Shovel/bags."}
{"elite_guards_shock_assault(rus_guard)" "The Elite Guards Shock SMG Squad is an 11-man skill 7 squad, capable of close range assault missions with maximum accuracy. The squad is useful for assaulting enemy positions at close range. Primary Weapons:6x PPS-43 SMg 4x PPSh-41 SMg 1x M2 Flamethrower. Throwables:20x F1 AP Grenade 11x Smoke Grenade 9x RPG-43 AT Grenade 1x Incendiary Mixture. Consumables:30x First Aid Kit. This squad has a 5 minute timer between spawns."}
{"elite_guards_shock(rus_guard)" "The Elite Guards Shock Rifle Squad is an 11-man skill 7 squad, capable of medium range assault missions with maximum accuracy. The squad is useful for assaulting enemy positions at medium range. Primary Weapons:4x Mosin Nagant 1891/30 Rifle 3x SVT-40 Rifle 2x PPS-43 1x DP-27 LMg 1x MG-34 LMG. Throwables:18x F1 AP Grenade 8x Smoke Grenade 6x RPG-43 AT Grenade 2x Incenadiary Mixture. Consumables:33x First Aid kit."}
{"ap_miners(rus_guard)" "The AP Miners is a 4-man skill 4 team, useful for laying down anti-personnel mines and barbed wire entanglements. Primary Weapons:4x PPSh-41 SMG. Consumables:20x First Aid Kit. Deployables:100x AP Mine 4x (infinite) Barbed Wire"}
{"at_miners(rus_guard)" "The AT Miners is a 4-man skill 4 team, useful for laying down anti-tank mines and hedgehog traps. Primary Weapons:4x PPSh-41 SMG. Consumables:20x First Aid Kit. Deployables:32x AT Mine 4x (infinite) Hedgehog Trap"}
{"vehic_supporter(rus_guard)" "The Support Crew is a 2-man skill 4 team, useful for taking control of crewed Weapons or driving mechanized vehicles. Primary Weapons:2x Mosin nagant 1891/30 Rifle. Consumables:6x First Aid kit."}
{"tankmans(rus_guard)" "The Tank Crew is a 5-man skill 5 team, useful for re-crewing armored vehicles. Primary Weapons:1x PPS-43 SMg 4x Nagant M1895 Revolver Pistol. Consumables:15x First Aid kit."}
{"elite_tankmans(rus_guard)" "The Veteran Guards Tank Crew is a 1-man skill 6 vehicle crew commander, useful for increasing the accuracy of armored vehicle Weapons.Primary Weapon:1x PPS-43 SMG. Throwables:2x F1 Grenade. Consumables:5x First Aid kit."}
{"riflemans2(rus_guard)" "A single skill 5 rifleman. Weapons:1x Mosin Nagant 1891/30 Rifle. Throwables:2x F1 Grenade 1x Incendiary Mixture. Consumables:5x First Aid Kit. Extra:1x DP-27 LMG Magazine"}
{"rifle_sa(rus_guard)" "A single skill 5 rifleman. Weapons:1x SVT-40 Rifle. Throwables:2x F1 Grenade 1x Incendiary Mixture. Consumables:5x First Aid Kit. Extra:1x DP-27 LMG Magazine"}
{"smg(rus_guard)" "A single skill 5 SMG soldier. Weapons:1x PPSh-41. Throwables:2x F1 Grenade 1x Smoke Grenade. Consumables:5x First Aid kit."}
{"at_rifles(rus_guard)" "The PTRS-AT Rifle Team is a 2-man skill 5 team, capable of engaging light armoured vehicles. The PTRS-41 Anti Tank Rifle is useful for disabling or destroying light skinned vehicles. It can kill crew members and destroy vehicles. It has a maximum range of 120 meters. Weapons:1x PTRS-41 AT Rifle 1x PPSh-41 SMG. Throwables:2x F1 AP Grenade 2x RPG-43 AT Grenade 1x Smoke Grenad. Extra:x45 rounds of PTRS-41 ammunition"}
{"bazookers(rus_guard)" "The Guards Bazooka Team is a 2-man skill 5 team, capable of engaging light and medium armoured vehicles. The M1A1 Bazooka fires a 60mm high-explosive anti-tank rockets, capable of penetrating and most medium armoured vehicles. It has a maximum range of 75 metersWeapons:1x M1A1 Bazooka1x PPSh-41 SMG. Throwables:2x F1 AP Grenade 2x RPG-43 AT Grenade 1x Smoke Grenade. Consumables:6x First Aid Kit. Extra:x11 rounds of M6A1 60mm HEAT rockets. This squad has a 5 minute timer between spawns."}
{"bazookers_piat(rus_guard)" "The Guards Piat Team is a 2-man skill 5 team, capable of engaging light, medium, and heavy armoured vehicles. The PIAT Mk. I fires a 38mm high-explosive anti-tank projectile, capable of penetrating most heavy armoured vehicles. It has a maximum range of 70 meters. The PIAT fires its projectile in an upward arc, similar to a mortar. Weapons:1x PIAT Mk. I1x PPSh-41 SMG. Throwables:2x F1 AP Grenade 2x RPG-43 AT Grenade 1x Smoke Grenade. Consumables:6x First Aid Kit. Extra:x11 rounds of PIAT projectiles. This squad has a 5 minute timer between spawns."}
{"mgs2(rus_guard)" "The Guards DP-27 Team is a 2-man skill 5 team, a machine gunner and ammo bearer.This team is useful for setting up a hasty machine gun position. Weapons:1x DP-27 LMg 1x Mosin Nagant 1891/30 Rifle. Throwables:2x F1 AP Grenade. Deployables:1x Shovel/bags."}
{"snipers(rus_guard)" "The Guards Mosin Sniper Team is a 2-man skill 6 team, consisting of two veteran snipers.This team is useful for engaging enemy infantry at long range. Weapons:2x Mosin Nagant 1891/30 w/ PU Scope. Consumables:10x First Aid Kit. Deployables:6x Camouflage kit."}
{"snipers3(rus_guard)" "The Guards SVT-40 Sniper Team is a 2-man skill 6 team, consisting of two veteran snipers.This team is useful for engaging enemy infantry at long range, at a higher rate of fire than a Mosin Nagant. Weapons:2x SVT-40 w/ PU Scope. Consumables:10x First Aid Kit. Deployables:6x Camouflage kit."}
{"officers(rus_guard)" "The Guards Officer is a single command unit, capable of observing enemy positions with binoculars, calling in airborne supply drops, increasing the maximum available Command Points, and improving the regeneration of MP Points gained from downed units.A maximum of 3 officers can be purchased. Weapons:1x TT-33 Pistol. Throwables:5x Signal Grenade  - Heavy Ammo Paradrop. Extra:1x Binocular."}
